    "updated_at": "2020-09-29T04:59:47Z",
    "body": "FWIW, I regret making the decision to default the second value to `auto`. If it were Web-compatible, I'd make the unprefixed property parse like -webkit-background-size.\r\n\r\n@zcorpan Particularly given that single-value syntax isn't the same as doubling it, which is the typical pattern in CSS, serializing as two values feels pretty reasonable here.",
