    "body": "If they're parsed differently, always serializing two values seems better.\r\n\r\nIs there interest in trying to change the unprefixed property to match the -webkit- prefixed property as @fantasai suggested in https://github.com/whatwg/compat/issues/28#issuecomment-700427017 ?",
